  },
  {
   "type": "callout",
   "variant": "exam-tip",
   "label": "Exam Hint",
   "md": "- The formulae for some of these derivatives are not given in the formulae booklet – you need to know them.\n- The formulae for ***e***<sup>***kx***</sup> and **ln *****x*** are the ones you absolutely do need to know .\n- The other formulae can be derived from those two as shown above, and remember – the derivative of **ln *****kx*** is $\\frac{1}{x}$*, *NOT $\\frac{k}{x}$ !"
